	(text "2600 cable interface -- J2 is the original FROB card's DIP-24 socket (2732 pin-out; /CE = A12 inverted\non the cable adapter, /OE grounded there, pin 24 open).  Every cable signal goes through a 74LVC245A on\nthe card's 3.3 V (5 V-tolerant, Ioff: the 2600 has its own supply).  U7 /OE = /CE | V_DOE_N (U8)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
